%   match = verified   -- the source was read far enough to know it describes what the code does
%           candidate  -- known to exist and to be the right kind of source, but not read
%                         far enough; check before citing it in a paper
% Written 2026-10-20. Nothing in this repository is a published method of its own: the
% sources below are the standards and libraries the code implements or calls.

